## Scope clarification

This MIT grant covers original repository text and configuration created by Brajesh Kumar, including original documentation and workflow/configuration files. It does not grant rights to third-party material merely because that material is stored in this repository.

The existing profile `README.md` is not modified by this documentation work. Its original text remains attributable to its author; embedded external images, badges, feeds, and linked services retain their providers' terms.

Files under `assets/` include image, badge, logo, and animation material whose individual creators and licenses are not recorded consistently in this repository. They are excluded from the MIT grant unless a separate notice in the relevant file says otherwise.

The `thoughtworks-gif_dribbble.gif` file is an image asset, not source code. Its inclusion here does not establish its creator, source, or redistribution permission; verify those rights before reusing it.

The SVG files under `profile-3d-contrib/` are generated profile visuals. This repository does not claim ownership of the generator, upstream data, fonts, artwork, or other material incorporated by the generator.

The contribution-snake SVG files under `output/` are generated by a third-party GitHub Action from contribution activity. Their generator and the underlying GitHub marks remain subject to their respective terms.

Any third-party badges, logos, icons, screenshots, or artwork under `assets/` remain subject to their respective owners' rights. Check provenance and applicable terms before copying or distributing those files.

External image URLs, feeds, statistics services, and other linked resources referenced by the profile are not included in this license grant and may have separate terms, availability, or privacy practices.

The GitHub, GitHub Actions, Medium, WakaTime, Holopin, and other service names and marks are used as references in profile configuration. No trademark or endorsement rights are granted by this license.

A generated file is not automatically licensed under MIT solely because a workflow writes it into this repository. Review its generator's license and the rights in the data used to create it.

If an asset carries its own license, attribution, or source notice, that asset-specific notice controls for that material. Preserve required notices when permitted redistribution applies.

Where the repository does not identify an asset's source or license, this file makes no claim that the asset is available for reuse. Ask the rights holder or replace the asset with material having documented reuse terms.
